		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Fey tundra spirit. Head is a caribou skull, body is a rag- wrapped skeleton adorned in carved ivory amulets.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 11, <strong>HP</strong> 33, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 antler +5 (2d6) or snow curse (far), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +1, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 7</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Snow Curse</strong>. WIS 15+ or DISADV on checks involving snow or ice.</p><p></p><p><strong>Snow Spirit</strong>. Assume the form of a caribou. When standing still, blend into ice and snow.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
